==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|бу́да|-ка}}, the former of which has been displaced by the suffixed formation and is from {{der|ru|uk|бу́да}}, from {{der|ru|pl|buda}}, from {{der|ru|gmh|buode}} = {{cog|de|Bude}}, from {{der|ru|gem-pro|*bōdō}} as {{cog|en|booth}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|бу́дка}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-будка.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-будка.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|бу́дка|*|dim=бу́дочка}}

# [[kennel]], [[doghouse]]
# [[booth]], [[cabin]], [[kiosk]], [[box]] {{gloss|very small building}}
# {{lb|ru|history}} small police facility {{gloss|during pre-revolutionary Russia}}

